// The Bound Ring (WP-066, D7): a ring of standing stones on a frozen plateau west of Rimeshelf's
// pass, 128 x 128 m. Y is up and the Ring lies north (+Z) of the road. Touching the sigil inside
// the stones seals the way you came in, with the prisoner (B11, the Bound Exile: an M7 work
// package, so the sigil is unarmed until it exists). See docs/game/02-world.md, "Mini-dungeons"
// (D7), and the notes at the top of terrain.ron, layout.ron, and entities.ron. L21 stands outside,
// in Rimeshelf.
(
  id: "bound_ring",
  name: "The Bound Ring",
  seed: 20262703,
  bounds: (min: (-64.0, -64.0), max: (64.0, 64.0)),
  kill_y: -60.0,
  start_glimmer: 0,
  // Low sun on old snow: a long, pale, slightly violet light, no fog to hide the stones.
  ambient: (
